        "question": "What is the Turkish Mavi Kart (Blue Card)?",
        "answer": "The Mavi Kart (Turkish: Blue Card) is an official document issued by Turkey to former Turkish citizens who renounced their Turkish citizenship with government permission — typically to acquire another nationality such as German citizenship. It documents the continuation of certain rights in Turkey under Article 28 of the Turkish Citizenship Law (Türk Vatandaşlığı Kanunu — TVK, Law No. 5901). Historically known as the Pembe Kart (Pink Card) or İzin Belgesi, the current Mavi Kart format was established with the 2009 reform of Turkish citizenship law."
